I come into my building's compound.
There are three cloth bags in my hands.
All the bags are very heavy.
I see Asha.
She also sees me.
Asha comes to me quickly.
She asks, "Maya, do you need help?"
I say, "Yes Asha, I need help."
Asha takes one bag.
This bag is the heaviest.
There is rice in it.
We go upstairs together.
Asha likes my cloth bags.
She says, "Maya, these bags are very good."
I like my new friend a lot.
She is a good neighbour.
We reach my door.
I am happy now.
I say, "Thank you for your help, Asha."
